    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The silence is the only thing that feels real anymore. Even the shadows feel more honest than my memories. I look at my sword, just lying there in the dust, and it's the only thing that hasn't betrayed me. It's the only constant left. I keep thinking... maybe a story shouldn't just fade away into nothingness. Maybe it needs a definitive end. A way to make the silence permanent so the pain finally stops.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
