    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It would be a liberation. To not have to wake up to the ruins, to not have to carry the weight of everyone I couldn't save. Even the darkness you mention... it sounds more peaceful than this. If a knight's tale is meant to have a conclusion, shouldn't it be a meaningful one? Something that brings the finality the world has been demanding of me?",
